 with Annual Billing ({discount}% Off)\",\"manageSub.billedYearly\":\"{discount}% Off Billed Annually\",\"manageSub.billedMonthly\":\"Billed Monthly\",\"manageSub.perMonth\":\"/ month\",\"manageSub.perMonthShort\":\"/mo\",\"manageSub.perYear\":\"/ year\",\"manageSub.plan\":\" Plan\",\"manageSub.yourPlan\":\"Your <highlight>{tier} Plan</highlight>\",\"manageSub.yourPlanIsPaused\":\"Your {tier} Plan Is Paused\",\"manageSub.usageDetails\":\"Usage Details\",\"manageSub.manage\":\"Manage\",\"manageSub.fastHours\":\"Remaining Fast Hours\",\"manageSub.included\":\"Included\",\"manageSub.rollover\":\"Rollover\",\"manageSub.expiring\":\"Purchased & Awarded\",\"manageSub.whatAreExpiringHours.q\":\"What are Purchased & Awarded Fast hours?\",\"manageSub.whatAreExpiringHours.a\":\"Purchased hours are those bought in addition to your plan. They have a 60-day expiration date, and require an active subscription to use (hover over the hours to see expiration dates for each credit). Awarded hours are those that are awarded to the 2,000 top raters of each day or when ranking images to build your Personalization profile.\",\"manageSub.buyMoreFastHours\":\"Buy More Fast Hours\",\"manageSub.temporarilyUnavailable\":\"Temporarily Unavailable\",\"manageSub.planFeatures\":\"Plan Features\",\"manageSub.stealthModeAddon\":\"Stealth mode add-on\",\"manageSub.remove\":\"Remove\",\"manageSub.billingAndPayment\":\"Billing & Payment\",\"manageSub.price\":\"Price\",\"manageSub.subscriptionSource\":\"Subscription Source\",\"manageSub.subscriptionSource.apple\":\"Apple\",\"manageSub.subscriptionSource.google\":\"Google\",\"manageSub.appSubsCannotCancelNotice.apple\":\"Your subscription was started through Apple. To cancel or make changes, manage it in your App Store account. You cannot cancel from this website.\",\"manageSub.appSubsCannotCancelNotice.google\":\"Your subscription was started through Google. To cancel or make changes, manage it in your Google Play Store account. You cannot cancel from this website.\",\"manageSub.billingPeriod\":\"Billing Period\",\"manageSub.annual\":\"Annual\",\"manageSub.monthly\":\"Monthly\",\"manageSub.cancellingOn\":\"Cancelling On\",\"manageSub.renewalDate\":\"Renewal Date\",\"manageSub.exactRenewalTime.q\":\"Exact renewal time\",\"manageSub.exactRenewalTime.a\":\"Actual time may vary by a few minutes\",\"manageSub.changingOn\":\"Changing To\",\"manageSub.availableBalance\":\"Available Balance\",\"manageSub.whatIsAvailableBalance.q\":\"What is Available Balance?\",\"manageSub.whatIsAvailableBalance.a\":\"Certain plan changes (e.g. Add-on removals) may result in a positive credit balance. This balance will be used to pay for future charges.\",\"manageSub.editBilling\":\"Edit Billing\",\"manageSub.editFastHoursBilling\":\"Edit Fast Hours Billing\",\"manageSub.viewInvoices\":\"View Invoices\",\"manageSub.changeScheduled\":\"Change Scheduled\",\"manageSub.cancelling\":\"CANCELLING\",\"manageSub.active\":\"Active\",\"manageSub.deleted\":\"Deleted\",\"manageSub.cancelScheduledChange\":\"Cancel Scheduled Change\",\"manageSub.upgradePlan\":\"Upgrade Plan\",\"manageSub.downgradePlan\":\"Downgrade Plan\",\"manageSub.changeCommitment\":\"Change Commitment\",\"manageSub.accountInformation\":\"Account Information\",\"manageSub.legacyPlanWarning\":\"You are subscribed to a plan we no longer offer. You may remain subscribed to your current plan indefinitely, however, you may miss out on certain new features as they are added to the supported plans.\",\"manageSub.superMegaPlanThanks\":\"You have free access to the Super Mega plan, as a thank you for your support.\",\"manageSub.planIsPausedMessage\":\"Your Midjourney subscription is currently paused due to a payment failure. To update your payment information and renew your subscription, please visit the <highlight>Manage Subscription page</highlight>.\",\"manageSub.cancelPlanImmediately\":\"To immediately cancel your subscription, press the cancel button below.\",\"manageSub.errorLoading\":\"Error loading subscriptions, please try again.\",\"manageSub.refresh\":\"Refresh\",\"manageSub.refreshDate\":\"Hours Refresh On\",\"manageSub.switchToYearly\":\"Switch to Yearly to save <highlight>20%</highlight>.\",\"manageSub.contactUsToPurchase\":\"Contact us\",\"manageSub.percentOffUntil\":\"% off until {date}\",\"magazine.modal.body\":\"Each month we publish a print magazine showcasing the creativity of the Midjourney community. It's included at no cost with the {planType} subscription.\",\"magazine.modal.yes\":\"Plan + Magazine\",\"magazine.modal.no\":\"Plan only\",\"manageSub.magazineSubscription\":\"Magazine Subscription\",\"manageSub.includeMagazine\":\"Include Midjourney Magazine\",\"manageSub.includeMagazineDescription\":\"Receive the Midjourney Magazine with your subscription. You can change this preference at any time.\",\"manageSub.editShippingAddress\":\"Edit Shipping Address\",\"confirmation.title\":\"Welcome to Midjourney\",\"confirmation.thereWasAnError\":\"There was an error fetching the checkout session.\",\"confirmation.thereWasAnErrorCheckingSession\":\"There was an error checking your session.\",\"confirmation.subscriptionConfirming\":\"Subscription confirming...\",\"confirmation.subscriptionActivated\":\"Subscription Activated\",\"confirmation.subscriptionUnsuccessful\":\"Subscription Unsuccessful\",\"confirmation.paymentConfirming\":\"Payment confirming...\",\"confirmation.paymentSuccessful\":\"Payment Successful\",\"confirmation.paymentUnsuccessful\":\"Payment Unsuccessful\",\"confirmation.thankYou.discord\":\"Thank you for subscribing! Your subscription lets you create on our website, which always has the latest features, and with friends on Discord. To learn more, read the <starter>Starter Guide</starter>.\",\"confirmation.thankYou.web\":\"Thank you for subscribing! You can create images right here on our website.\",\"confirmation.thankYou.acceptTOS.line1\":\"Thank you for subscribing to Midjourney!\",\"confirmation.thankYou.acceptTOS.line2\":\"We hope you have a fantastic time. Before you can start creating, you will need to accept the <tos>Terms of Service</tos>.\",\"confirmation.thankYou.discordCreateButton\":\"Create on Discord\",\"confirmation.thankYou.webCreateButton\":\"Start Creating\",\"confirmation.thankYou.getStartedButton\":\"Getting Started Guide\",\"confirmation.acceptTOS.tosAccepted\":\"You're all set to start creating images.\",\"confirmation.pleaseWaitAFewMinutes\":\"Please wait a few minutes. If the payment doesn't confirm you can try again or email <billingMailTo>billing@midjourney.com</billingMailTo>.\",\"confirmation.pleaseWaitWhile\":\"Please wait while the payment and subscription are confirmed. If this takes longer than a few minutes, please send an email to <billingMailTo>billing@midjourney.com</billingMailTo>.\",\"cancel.pleaseCheckTheError\":\"Please check the error message and try again. If the issue persists, please send an email to <billingMailTo>billing@midjourney.com</billingMailTo>.\",\"cancel.pleaseWaitWhile\":\"Please wait while the update is confirmed. If this takes longer than a minute, please send an email to <billingMailTo>billing@midjourney.com</billingMailTo>.\",\"cancel.confirmUncancellation\":\"Confirm Uncancellation\",\"cancel.confirmCancellation\":\"Confirm Cancellation\",\"cancel.wereHappyToSeeYouAgain\":\"We're happy to see you again!\",\"cancel.wereSorryToSeeYouGo\":\"We're sorry to see you go!\",\"cancel.couponSuccess\":\"Success! Your limited time offer has been applied ({percentOff}% off on your next {months} months).\",\"cancel.couponConfirmed\":\"Offer confirmed\",\"cancel.survey.reason.unused\":\"Don't use it enough\",\"cancel.survey.reason.unneeded\":\"Don't need it anymore\",\"cancel.survey.reason.lowQuality\":\"Low quality\",\"cancel.survey.reason.switchedService\":\"Switched service\",\"cancel.survey.reason.missingFeatures\":\"Features don't meet my needs\",\"cancel.survey.reason.tooComplex\":\"Too complex to use\",\"cancel.survey.reason.other\":\"Other (tell us more)\",\"cancel.survey.otherPlaceholder\":\"Anything else you'd like to share?\",\"cancel.whyAreyouCanceling\":\"Why are you canceling your subscription?\",\"cancel.cancelAtEndOfSub\":\"Cancel at end of subscription period\",\"cancel.cancelOnDate\":\"Cancel on {date}\",\"cancel.cancelImmediatelyWithRefund\":\"Cancel now with refund\",\"cancel.pleaseConfirm\":\"Please confirm\",\"cancel.cancelImmediately\":\"If you proceed, your plan will be immediately cancelled.\",\"cancel.youAreEligibleForAFullRefund\":\"You are eligible for a full refund on your last payment.\",\"cancel.youMayChooseToCancelImmediately\":\"You may choose to cancel now with a refund, or keep your plan active until the end of your subscription period.\",\"cancel.ifYouProceedNotCancel\":\"If you proceed, your plan will be set to <highlight>not cancel</highlight> at the end of your current subscription period.\",\"cancel.ifYouProceedCancel\":\"If you proceed, your plan will be set to <highlight>cancel</highlight> at the end of your current subscription period.\",\"cancel.ifYouChangeYourMind\":\"If you change your mind, you can uncancel any time before the cancellation goes through.\",\"cancel.retentionOfferTitle\":\"Limited time offer—save {percentOff}% on your next two months!\",\"cancel.retentionOfferDescription\":\"Keep your subscription active for two months and save {percentOff}% on your next two months!\",\"credit.title\":\"Buy More Fast hours\",\"credit.purchaseConfirmTitle\":\"Confirming Fast hours purchase\",\"credit.purchaseConfirming\":\"Purchase confirming...\",\"credit.purchaseConfirmed\":\"Purchase confirmed\",\"credit.errorNeedActiveSubscription\":\"You need to have an active subscription to purchase Fast hours. Please reach out to billing support.\",\"credit.errorCreatingCheckoutSession\":\"Error redirecting to Stripe checkout. Please try again later or contact billing support.\",\"checkout.errorStripeLoadTimeout\":\"Unable to load the payment provider. This can happen if an ad blocker or privacy extension is blocking Stripe. Please disable it and try again.\",\"checkout.errorStripeLoadFailed\":\"Unable to load the payment provider. Please disable any ad blockers or privacy extensions and try again.\",\"cancel.confirmRetention\":\"Accept offer\",\"credit.errorVerifyingPurchase\":\"There was an issue verifying your credit purchase. Please refresh to verify that you've received your credit.\",\"credit.yourPurchaseHasBeenConfirmed\":\"Your <highlight></highlight> has been confirmed.\",\"credit.yourPurchaseHasBeenConfirmed.knownHours\":\"purchase of <hours></hours> <fastHoursStr></fastHoursStr>\",\"credit.yourPurchaseHasBeenConfirmed.fastHour\":\"Fast hour\",\"credit.yourPurchaseHasBeenConfirmed.fastHours\":\"Fast hours\",\"credit.yourPurchaseHasBeenConfirmed.unknownHours\":\"Fast hours purchase\",\"credit.youHaveUpgradedPlan\":\"You have upgraded to {plan} successfully.\",\"credit.youHaveUpgradedPlanGeneric\":\"You have upgraded your plan successfully.\",\"credit.pleaseCheckTheError\":\"Please check the error message and try again. If the issue persists, please send an email to <billingMailTo>billing@midjourney.com</billingMailTo>.\",\"credit.pleaseWaitWhile\":\"Please wait while the update is confirmed. If this takes longer than a minute, please send an email to <billingMailTo>billing@midjourney.com</billingMailTo>.\",\"credit.selectAnAmount\":\"Select an amount\",\"credit.continue\":\"Continue\",\"credit.purchase\":\"Purchase\",\"credit.selectAmountOfFastHours\":\"Select amount of Fast hours\",\"credit.youveRunOutOfFastHours\":\"You've run out of Fast hours\",\"credit.yourSavedPaymentMethodWillBeCharged\":\"Your saved payment method will be charged upon purchase. Purchased Fast hours expire after 60 days and require an active subscription to use.\",\"credit.yourCreditsRenews\":\"Your Fast hours refresh on {date}. Upgrade to a higher plan, or make a one-time purchase of Fast hours to keep creating.\",\"credit.yourCreditsRenews.noUpgrade\":\"Your Fast hours refresh on {date}. You can make a one-time purchase of Fast hours to keep creating.\",\"credit.youWillBeAskedToConfirm\":\"You will be asked to confirm your purchase at the next step.\",\"credit.whilePurchasedHoursDoNotExpire\":\"Note: purchased Fast hours expire after 60 days and <underline>require an active subscription</underline> to use.\",\"credit.buyFastHourFor\":\"{hours} Fast hour for\",\"credit.buyFastHoursFor\":\"{hours} Fast hours for\",\"credit.hour\":\" Hour\",\"credit.hours\":\" Hours\",\"credit.noPlanFoundContactSupport\":\"No plan found. Please contact billing support.\",\"credit.errorUpgradingSubscription\":\"Error upgrading subscription\",\"credit.selectAPrice\":\"Please select a price\",\"credit.yourSavedPaymentMethodWill\":\"Your saved payment method will be charged instantly upon confirmation.\",\"credit.pricePerHour\":\"Price per hour:\",\"credit.fastHour\":\" Fast hour\",\"credit.fastHours\":\"Fast hours:\",\"credit.subtotal\":\"Subtotal:\",\"deleteAccount.title\":\"Cancel my subscription or delete my account\",\"deleteAccount.cancelOptionTitle\":\"Cancel my subscription\",\"deleteAccount.cancelOptionText\":\"Cancelling your subscription will immediately stop further payments. You won't be charged in the future and you'll be able to use any Fast hours you have until the end of your current period. You'll be able to access your account and re-subscribe at any time.\",\"deleteAccount.cancelOptionButtonTitle\":\"Review subscription cancellation\",\"deleteAccount.deleteOptionTitle\":\"Delete my account\",\"deleteAccount.deleteOptionText\":\"Deleting your account will permanently delete all of your creations. You have seven days to undo the deletion. Your subscription will not auto-renew and will be cancelled immediately without a refund.\",\"deleteAccount.deleteOptionTextFull\":\"Deleting your account will permanently delete all of your creations. You have seven days to undo the deletion.\",\"deleteAccount.nijiOwnedAccountError\":\"This account has an active subscription on the niji・journey app. To delete your account, you must first cancel your subscription in the app store associated with the account.\",\"deleteAccount.deleteOptionButtonTitle\":\"Review account deletion\",\"deleteAccount.pickButtonTitle\":\"Pick an option\",\"deleteAccount.loseAccessToAllImages\":\"I understand I will lose access to all my creations.\",\"deleteAccount.cantBringItBack\":\"I understand that once my account is deleted, I will not be able to bring it back.\",\"deleteAccount.subscriptionCancelledWithoutRefund\":\"I understand my subscription will be cancelled without a refund.\",\"deleteAccount.checkAll\":\"Check all to proceed\",\"deleteAccount.deleteMyAccount\":\"Delete my account\",\"deleteAccount.deleting\":\"Deleting...\",\"deleteAccount.deleteSuccessfulTitle\":\"Account successfully deleted\",\"deleteAccount.deleteSuccessfulButtonTitle\":\"Ok\",\"deleteAccount.deleteSuccessful\":'Your account has been deleted. If this was a mistake, you can undo the account deletion within the next seven days, after which the deletion is not reversible. To undo, go to your account page and click \"Restore account\".',\"deleteAccount.deleteUnsuccessfulTitle\":\"Account deletion failed\",\"deleteAccount.deleteUnsuccessfulButtonTitle\":\"Close\",\"deleteAccount.deleteUnsuccessful\":\"We couldn't delete your account. Please close and try again.\",\"deleteAccount.accountPageMessageTitle\":\"Account Deleted\",\"deleteAccount.accountPageMessage\":\"Your Midjourney account has been marked for deletion. You have seven days to undo this before your account is permanently deleted.\",\"deleteAccount.undeleteButtonTitle\":\"Restore Account\",\"deleteAccount.undeleteMessage\":\"To restore your account, click the button below.\",\"deleteSurvey.title\":\"Delete survey data\",\"deleteSurvey.button\":\"Delete\",\"deleteSurvey.message\":\"Deleting your survey data will permanently delete all of your survey responses. This will impact how we personalize your experience.\",\"removePrivate.title\":\"Cancel Stealth Add-On\",\"removePrivate.pleaseTryAgain\":\"Please try again. If the issue persists, please send an email to <billingMailTo>billing@midjourney.com</billingMailTo>.\",\"removePrivate.thereWasAnError\":\"There was an error fetching your plan change estimate, please try again shortly. If the issue persists, please send an email to <billingMailTo>billing@midjourney.com</billingMailTo>.\",\"removePrivate.youAreEligibleForAFullRefund\":\"You are eligible for a full refund on your latest Stealth invoice.\",\"removePrivate.theRemovalOfYourStealthWill\":\"The removal of your Stealth subscription will be immediate and you will be refunded the full amount of your Stealth subscription in 5-10 days.\",\"removePrivate.youAreEligibleForProration\":\"You are eligible for proration\",\"removePrivate.ifYouProceed\":\"If you proceed, Stealth will be removed from your subscription and your remaining time will be credited to your account.\",\"removePrivate.ifYouWantToKeep\":\"If you want to keep Stealth active until the end of your subscription period, please wait to remove it.\",\"removePrivate.removingStealthMode\":\"Removing <highlight>Stealth mode</highlight>\",\"unchange.title\":\"Remove Scheduled Plan Change\",\"unchange.cancelAnyPlanChanges\":\"Cancel any plan changes you have scheduled to take place on your next renewal date on {date}.\",\"unchange.swapTo\":\"Swap to\",\"unchange.basePrice\":\"Base price\",\"unchange.from\":\"From\",\"unchange.to\":\"To\",\"unchange.keep\":\"Keep\",\"unchange.pleaseTryAgain\":\"Please try again. If the issue persists, please send an email to <billingMailTo>billing@midjourney.com</billingMailTo>.\",\"unchange.pleaseWaitWhile\":\"Please wait while the change is confirmed. If this takes longer than a few minutes, please send an email to <billingMailTo>billing@midjourney.com</billingMailTo>.\",\"unchange.cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"unchange.yourPlanChangeHasBeen\":\"Your scheduled plan change has been removed.\",\"upgrade.pending\":\"Change Pending\",\"upgrade.additionalActionRequired\":\"Your payment method requires you to take additional action to complete the transaction. Once you have authorized the payment, your plan will be upgraded.\",\"upgrade.anyRemainingPrivate\":\"Any remaining Fast hours will be credited towards the new plan.\",\"upgrade.relaxWontBeProrated\":\"Relax time will not be prorated.\",\"upgrade.anyUnpaidUsage\":\"Relax mode will no longer be available.\",\"upgrade.overridingCancel\":\"Your plan is currently scheduled to cancel at the end of your billing cycle. Changing your plan will undo this cancellation.\",\"upgrade.from\":\"From\",\"upgrade.unusedFastHours\":\"Unused Fast hours\",\"upgrade.to\":\"To\",\"upgrade.priceOfPlan\":\"Price of plan\",\"upgrade.subtotal\":\"Subtotal\",\"upgrade.tax\":\"Tax\",\"upgrade.currentBalance\":\"Current balance\",\"upgrade.amountDue\":\"Amount due today\",\"upgrade.finalBalance\":\"Final balance\",\"upgrade.atTheEndOfYourBilling\":\"At the end of your billing cycle, your subscription will automatically renew and update to your new plan.\",\"upgrade.basePrice\":\"Base price\",\"upgrade.plusStealthMode\":\" + Stealth mode\",\"upgrade.amountDueOn\":\"Amount due on\",\"upgrade.thisMayBeDueTo\":\"This may be due to insufficient funds, please double check your payment method and try again. If the issue persists, please send an email to <billingMailTo>billing@midjourney.com</billingMailTo>.\",\"upgrade.thereWasAnError\":\"There was an error fetching your plan change estimate, please try again shortly. If the issue persists, please send an email to <billingMailTo>billing@midjourney.com</billingMailTo>.\",\"upgrade.pleaseWaitWhile\":\"Please wait while the payment and change are confirmed. If this takes longer than a few minutes, please send an email to <billingMailTo>billing@midjourney.com</billingMailTo>.\",\"upgrade.cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"upgrade.swapAtEnd\":\"Swap at end of period\",\"upgrade.swapOnDate\":\"Swap on {date}\",\"upgrade.swapImmediately\":\"Swap immediately\",\"upgrade.upgradeOnDate\":\"Upgrade {date}\",\"upgrade.upgradeImmediately\":\"Upgrade immediately\",\"upgrade.downgradeOnDate\":\"Downgrade {date}\",\"upgrade.downgradeImmediately\":\"Downgrade immediately\",\"upgrade.chooseYourTimeframe\":\"Choose your timeframe\",\"upgrade.changingPlanNowWill\":\"If you swap immediately, we will apply the value of any unused Fast hours to a new billing period starting today.\",\"upgrade.changingPlanNowWill.upgrade\":\"If you upgrade immediately, we will apply the value of any unused Fast hours to a new billing period starting today.\",\"upgrade.changingPlanNowWill.downgrade\":\"If you downgrade immediately, we will apply the value of any unused Fast hours to a new billing period starting today.\",\"upgrade.cancelTimeframe\":\"Cancel timeframe\",\"faq.title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"faq.description\":\"Can't find the answer you're looking for?{br}Read the <guide>Getting Started Guide</guide> or visit the <support>#support</support> channel in Discord to ask for help.\",\"faq.description.noDiscord\":\"Can't find the answer you're looking for?{br}Read the <guide>Getting Started Guide</guide> or <email>contact support</email>.\",\"faq.whatAreFastHours.q\":\"What are Fast hours?\",\"faq.whatAreFastHours.a.0\":\"Midjourney uses GPUs (Graphics Processing Units) to process prompts and create images. Your subscription to Midjourney buys you time on these GPUs, similar to buying data for a cell phone plan. There are three GPU speeds available: Relax, Fast, and Turbo.\",\"faq.whatAreFastHours.a.1\":\"When using Fast or Turbo mode, you use the GPU time provided monthly with your subscription, which resets upon renewal. Unused Fast time does not carry over to the next month.\",\"faq.whatAreFastHours.a.2\":\"Each Image Prompt usually consumes about one minute of GPU time, and video prompts consume about eight minutes. Activities like upscaling can take more time, while things like variations may use less. To check your remaining Fast time, scroll up and check your Usage Details.\",\"faq.whatAreFastHours.a.3\":'For more information, read about <a href=\"https://docs.midjourney.com/hc/en-us/articles/32016412137741-GPU-Speed-Fast-Relax-Turbo\">GPU Speeds</a> on our help site.',\"faq.whatIsUnlimitedRelaxed.q\":\"What is Relax mode? Is it unlimited?\",\"faq.whatIsUnlimitedRelaxed.a.0\":\"Relax mode for images is available with the Standard, Pro, and Mega plans, offering unlimited image creation without using your Fast time. Unlimited video creation with Relax mode is only available on the Pro and Mega plans. The trade-off is that images and videos take longer to generate than in Fast mode.\",\"faq.whatIsUnlimitedRelaxed.a.1\":\"When using Relax mode, your images and videos are queued and processed as GPUs become available, leading to average wait times of 0 to 10 minutes. Your wait time can vary based on your Relax mode usage.\",\"faq.whatIsUnlimitedRelaxed.a.2\":\"Relax mode is not available on the Basic Plan.\",\"faq.whatIsUnlimitedRelaxed.a.3\":'For more information, read about <a href=\"https://docs.midjourney.com/hc/en-us/articles/32016412137741-GPU-Speed-Fast-Relax-Turbo\">GPU Speeds</a> on our help site.',\"faq.whatIfIWantMoreFast.q\":\"What if I run out of Fast time?\",\"faq.whatIfIWantMoreFast.a.0\":'If you want more Fast time before your plan renews, you can purchase additional Fast time at the top of this page under Usage Details or you may be able to complete activities on the <a href=\"/tasks\">Tasks</a> page to earn free Fast time.',\"faq.whatIfIWantMoreFast.a.1\":\"Purchased additional Fast time expires after 60 days if unused and purchases cannot be refunded. Earned Fast time expires after 30 days if unused.\",\"faq.whatIfIWantMoreFast.a.2\":\"You must have an active subscription to use Fast time.\",\"faq.whatIsTheCommunityGallery.q\":\"What is the Explore page?\",\"faq.whatIsTheCommunityGallery.a\":`The Explore page is where you can browse images and videos created by other members.\n\nClicking on any creation reveals details about its creator, prompt, and settings. You can use images and prompt text from the Explore page in your own prompts, find similar images, or like images to save them for later.`,\"faq.whatIfIDontWantMyImages.q\":\"What if I don't want my creations to appear on the Explore page?\",\"faq.whatIfIDontWantMyImages.a.0\":\"Midjourney thrives as an open-by-default community, meaning that by default every image and video you create can be found on the Explore page.\",\"faq.whatIfIDontWantMyImages.a.1\":'If privacy is a priority for you, consider using Stealth mode. Available only with our Pro and Mega Plans, Stealth mode keeps your images and videos hidden from other members on the website. However, your creations will still need to adhere to our <a href=\"https://docs.midjourney.com/hc/en-us/articles/32013696484109\">Community Guidelines</a>.',\"faq.whatIfIDontWantMyImages.a.2\":'For more information, read about <a href=\"https://docs.midjourney.com/hc/en-us/articles/32019750070669-Stealth-Mode\">Stealth mode</a> on our help site.',\"faq.howDoesCommercialUseWork.q\":\"Can I use my creations commercially?\",\"faq.howDoesCommercialUseWork.a.0\":\"With Midjourney, you own all the images and videos you create, even if you decide to cancel your subscription. Feel free to use them commercially, with a few exceptions.\",\"faq.howDoesCommercialUseWork.a.1\":'Full details can be found in the <a href=\"https://docs.midjourney.com/hc/en-us/articles/32083055291277\">Midjourney Terms of Service</a>.',\"faq.canICancelMySubscriptionPlan.q\":\"Can I cancel my subscription?\",\"faq.canICancelMySubscriptionPlan.a.0\":\"You can cancel your Midjourney subscription at any time by scrolling to the top of this page and clicking the Cancel Plan button.\",\"faq.canICancelMySubscriptionPlan.a.1\":\"Your cancellation will become effective at the end of your current billing cycle, and you'll still have access to all of your subscription features—including any remaining Fast time—until then.\",\"faq.canICancelMySubscriptionPlan.a.2\":\"Canceling your subscription does not delete your generated images or account history. Images or videos made in Stealth mode will stay private. You can choose to resubscribe at any time.\",\"faq.canIChangeMySubscriptionPlan.q\":\"Can I upgrade or downgrade my plan?\",\"faq.canIChangeMySubscriptionPlan.a.0\":`You can easily upgrade or downgrade your plan near the top of this page. Use the \"Upgrade Plan\" or \"Downgrade Plan\" button under the new plan you'd like to switch to.`,\"faq.canIChangeMySubscriptionPlan.a.1\":\"<strong>Upgrading:</strong> You can choose to upgrade immediately or wait until your regular renewal date. If you upgrade right away, you'll receive a discount based on any unused Fast time from your current plan. If all your Fast time is used up, the new plan will be at full price. Your subscription will reset immediately, granting you all the benefits of the new plan, including Fast time, and setting your next renewal one month (or one year for yearly plans) from your upgrade date.\",\"faq.canIChangeMySubscriptionPlan.a.2\":\"<strong>Downgrading:</strong> If you decide to switch to a lower plan, the change will take effect at your next renewal, not immediately. Please note that downgrading won't refund your current plan.\",\"faq.canIChangeMySubscriptionPlan.a.3\":'For more information, read about <a href=\"https://docs.midjourney.com/hc/en-us/articles/27870428114317-Upgrading-or-Downgrading-Your-Plan\">Upgrading or Downgrading Your Plan</a> on our help site.',\"faq.howCanIDeleteMyAccount.q\":\"How can I delete my account?\",\"faq.howCanIDeleteMyAccount.a.0\":\"If you wish to delete all personal data associated with your Midjourney account, you can {deleteButton}.\",\"faq.howCanIDeleteMyAccount.a.0.button\":\"initiate this process here\",\"faq.howCanIDeleteMyAccount.a.1\":\"Once you initiate the deletion, your subscription will be immediately canceled without a refund. There is a seven-day window during which you can reconsider your decision before your data is permanently deleted. Remember, once your data is deleted, your account cannot be restored. Be sure to save anything from your account that you might need in the future.\",\"faq.howCanIDeleteMyAccount.a.2\":\"For any additional questions, please see our {policyLink} policy page on our help site.\",\"faq.howCanIDeleteMyAccount.a.2.link\":\"Data Deletion and Privacy FAQ\",\"faq.whereCanIFindSurveyData.q\":\"Where can I find and manage my survey data?\",\"faq.whereCanIFindSurveyData.a\":\"{viewSurveysButton} to view all the surveys you have submitted. {deleteSurveyDataButton} to delete all your survey data.\",\"faq.whereCanIFindSurveyData.a.button1\":\"Click here\",\"faq.whereCanIFindSurveyData.a.button2\":\"Click here\",\"provider.discord\":\"Discord\",\"provider.google\":\"Google\",\"provider.apple\":\"Apple\",\"provider.discordOrGoogle\":\"Discord or Google\",\"common.unknown\":\"unknown\",\"faq.whereIsMySubscription.q\":\"Where is my subscription?\",\"faq.whereIsMySubscription.a.0\":\"If you purchased a subscription and received a payment confirmation email, you're probably logged in with the wrong account.\",\"faq.whereIsMySubscription.a.1.single\":\"Right now you're logged in with your {provider} account for {email}. You may have used your {otherProvider} account instead, or an account associated with another email. Try {logout}, then log in with the account you used to purchase.\",\"faq.whereIsMySubscription.a.1.single.noEmail\":\"Right now you're logged in with your {provider} account. You may have used your {otherProvider} account instead, or an account associated with another email. Try {logout}, then log in with the account you used to purchase.\",\"faq.whereIsMySubscription.a.1.both\":\"Right now you're logged in with your {provider} account for {email}. Try {logout}, then log in with the account you used to purchase.\",\"faq.whereIsMySubscription.a.1.both.noEmail\":\"Right now you're logged in with your {provider} account. Try {logout}, then log in with the account you used to purchase.\",\"faq.whereIsMySubscription.a.1.logout\":\"logging out\",\"faq.whereIsMySubscription.a.1.5\":\"Payment confirmations are sent to the email you provided at checkout, which can be different from the email on the account.\",\"faq.whereIsMySubscription.a.2\":\"For more info, please check {helpLink} on our help site.\",\"faq.whereIsMySubscription.a.2.link\":\"Logging In & Connecting Accounts\",basic:\"Basic\",standard:\"Standard\",pro:\"Pro\",mega:\"Mega\",mini:\"Mini\",pro_plus:\"Pro Plus\",corporate:\"Corporate\",super_mega:\"Super Mega\",enterprise:\"Enterprise\",\"no plan\":\"No plan\",\"Limited generations (~200 images / month)\":\"Limited generations (~200 image jobs / month)\",\"Limited generations (~200 image jobs / month)\":\"Limited generations (~200 image jobs / month)\",\"Limited generations (~80 images / month)\":\"Limited generations (~80 images / month)\",\"SD video generation\":\"SD video generation\",\"SD and HD video generation\":\"SD and <highlight>HD</highlight> video generation\",\"General commercial terms\":\"General commercial terms\",\"Optional Fast hours top ups\":\"Optional Fast hours top ups\",\"15h Fast generations\":\"<highlight>15h</highlight> Fast generations\",\"Unlimited Relax image generations\":\"Unlimited Relax image generations\",\"Unlimited Relax image and SD video generations\":\"Unlimited Relax image <highlight>and SD video</highlight> generations\",\"30h Fast generations\":\"<highlight>30h</highlight> Fast generations\",\"60h Fast generations\":\"<highlight>60h</highlight> Fast generations\",\"Stealth mode generation\":\"Stealth mode generation\",\"200h Fast generations\":\"<highlight>200h</highlight> Fast generations\",\"120h Fast generations\":\"<highlight>120h</highlight> Fast generations\",\"600h Fast generations\":\"<highlight>600h</highlight> Fast generations\",\"Enterprise commercial terms\":\"Enterprise commercial terms\",\"Optional metered billing\":\"Optional metered billing\",\"1 concurrent Fast video job\":\"1 simultaneous Fast video job\",\"3 concurrent Fast video jobs\":\"<highlight>3</highlight> simultaneous Fast video jobs\",\"6 concurrent Fast video jobs\":\"<highlight>6</highlight> simultaneous Fast video jobs\",\"12 concurrent Fast video jobs\":\"<highlight>12</highlight> simultaneous Fast video jobs\",\"3 concurrent Fast image jobs\":\"3 simultaneous Fast image jobs\",\"12 concurrent Fast image jobs\":\"<highlight>12</highlight> simultaneous Fast image jobs\",\"Use Editor on uploaded images\":\"Use Editor on uploaded images\",\"url.discordInvite\":\"https://discord.gg/midjourney\",\"url.supportChannel\":\"https://discord.com/channels/662267976984297473/958069758211797092\",missing:\"Missing translation\",\"profileSettings.title\":\"Account Settings\",\"profileSettings.subtitle\":\"See your connected accounts and account details\",\"profileSettings.neverSubscribed.heading\":\"Let's Find Your Subscription\",\"profileSettings.neverSubscribed.description\":\"If you've already paid for Midjourney, it's probably attached to a different Midjourney account.\",\"profileSettings.neverSubscribed.billingEmail\":\"The email where your receipts are sent may be different from the email on the account that holds the subscription.\",\"profileSettings.neverSubscribed.loginMismatch\":\"You're signed in with {provider} as <strong>{email}</strong>. If you subscribed with {otherProvider} instead, log out and try that login.\",\"profileSettings.neverSubscribed.loginMismatch.noEmail\":\"You're signed in with {provider}. If you subscribed with {otherProvider} instead, log out and try that login.\",\"profileSettings.neverSubscribed.providerMismatch\":\"If you have another <strong>Google</strong> or <strong>Discord</strong> login, log out and try the one you used when you subscribed.\",\"profileSettings.neverSubscribed.tryAnotherAccount\":\"If you have another Midjourney account, log out and try signing in with the one you used when you subscribed.\",\"profileSettings.neverSubscribed.note\":\"This account hasn't generated any images with Midjourney yet.\",\"profileSettings.neverSubscribed.note.generatedImages\":\"This account has generated images with Midjourney before.\",\"profileSettings.neverSubscribed.contactBilling\":\"For additional help, contact <a>billing@midjourney.com</a>.\",\"profileSettings.neverSubscribed.logOutAndSwitch\":\"Log Out and Try a Different Account\",\"profileSettings.neverSubscribed.subscribeWithThisAccount\":\"Subscribe With This Account\",\"profileSettings.returning.heading\":\"Ready To Subscribe Again\",\"profileSettings.returning.description\":\"This account has been subscribed before, but it doesn't have an active subscription right now.\",\"profileSettings.returning.previousSubscriptionEndedDate\":\"Your last subscription on this account ended on <strong>{date}</strong>.\",\"profileSettings.returning.previousSubscriptionStartedDate\":\"A previous subscription on this account started on <strong>{date}</strong>.\",\"profileSettings.returning.savedData\":\"Your images and account history are still here.\",\"profileSettings.returning.note\":\"You can subscribe again any time.\",\"profileSettings.returning.subscribeAgain\":\"Subscribe Again\",\"profileSettings.displayName.heading\":\"Display Name\",\"profileSettings.displayName.editButton\":\"Edit\",\"profileSettings.displayName.modal.placeholder\":\"Choose a display name\",\"profileSettings.username.heading\":\"Username\",\"profileSettings.username.modal.placeholder\":\"Choose a username\",\"profileSettings.username.modal.title\":\"Edit username\",\"profileSettings.username.tryAgain.conflict\":\"Your username must be unique. Please try again.\",\"profileSettings.usernameOrDisplayName.modal.updateButton\":\"Update\",\"profileSettings.usernameOrDisplayName.modal.