ing you need to know about making images on Midjourney\",\"help.links.billingSupport.title\":\"Billing Support\",\"help.links.billingSupport.description\":\"Having an issue with your account? Need support with a billing related matter? Click here.\",\"help.inkeepChatTitle\":\"Inkeep Chat\",\"content.imageUnpublished\":\"Private\",\"content.visible\":\"Visible\",\"content.inTrash\":\"In Trash\",\"upload.countUploading\":\"{count} Uploading\",\"upload.uploading\":\"Uploading\",\"upload.uploadingFiles\":\"Uploading your files...\",\"upload.dropFiles\":\"Drop files\",\"upload.dropFilesToUpload\":\"Drop files to upload\",\"upload.yourUploads\":\"Your Uploads\",\"upload.manageDescription\":\"Manage Image Prompts and described images.\",\"upload.nothingInTrash\":\"Nothing in Trash\",\"upload.emptyStateDescription\":\"You have not uploaded any images yet.\",\"verify.pleaseLoginToCreateAccount\":\"Please log in to create a new account:\",\"verify.doneLoginToCreateAccount\":\"Done. Please log in to create a new account.\",\"verify.createAccountWith\":\"To create a new account with {email}, the existing account needs to be disabled.\",\"verify.pleaseConfirm\":\"Please confirm by clicking the button below:\",\"verify.somethingWentWrong\":\"Something went wrong. Please try again.\",\"demographics.title\":\"Demographic aesthetic\",\"demographics.description\":\"Get averaged Personalization from members with specific demographics. It will only match members that pass every filter. If you enter multiple values for one question, the member must match at least one of them.\",\"demographics.balanceGenderImpact\":\"Balance gender impact\",\"demographics.submit\":\"Submit\",\"demographics.results\":\"Results\",\"demographics.resultsSavedBetweenSessions\":\"Results are saved between sessions\",\"demographics.filterCombinedPersonalization\":\"This filter combined the Personalization of {count} members\",\"demographics.filter\":\"Filter:\",\"dev.abilitiesTester\":\"[DEV] Abilities Tester\"