d to add images to Personalization\",\"error.personalization.createFailed\":\"Failed to create Personalization\",\"error.personalization.deleteFailed\":\"Failed to delete Personalization\",\"error.personalization.createOtherUser\":\"Can't create Personalization for another member\",\"error.personalization.editsStillSaving\":\"You have {count, plural, one {# edit} other {# edits}} still saving. If you leave now, your edits will be lost.\",\"error.moodboard.updateTitleFailed\":\"Failed to update moodboard title\",\"error.moodboard.createFailed\":\"Failed to create moodboard\",\"error.moodboard.deleteFailed\":\"Failed to delete moodboard\",\"error.moodboard.addImagesFailed\":\"Failed to add images to moodboard\",\"error.moodboard.removeImagesFailed\":\"Failed to remove images from moodboard\",\"error.moodboard.addFiltered\":\"Failed to add {count, plural, one {# image} other {# images}} to moodboard due to image filters.\",\"error.moodboard.createOtherUser\":\"Can't create moodboard for another member\",\"error.moodboard.maxImages\":\"You can only add {count} images to a moodboard, removing excess.\",\"error.moodboard.maxUploadAtOnce\":\"You can only upload {count} images at a time, removing excess.\",\"error.moodboard.moderatorRequiredRemove\":\"You are not a moderator, so you cannot remove images from this moodboard.\",\"error.moodboard.moderatorRequiredChangeTitle\":\"You are not a moderator, so you cannot change the title of this moodboard.\",\"error.moodboard.moderatorRequiredDelete\":\"You are not a moderator, so you cannot delete this moodboard.\",\"error.input.extendVideoLimit\":\"You can only extend up to {count} frames\",\"error.surveys.submitFailed\":\"There was an error submitting this survey.\",\"error.surveys.answerAllQuestions\":\"Please answer all the questions to submit.\",\"error.surveys.deleteFailed\":\"Survey deletion failed. Please contact support.\",\"error.mod.softBanFailedWithMessage\":\"Failed to soft ban: {message}\",\"error.mod.hideFailedWith