"noopener noreferrer\",children:\"modelcontextprotocol.io\"}),\".\"]})})]})},{title:\"Prerequisites\",body:q(a,{children:[q(\"ul\",{className:\"mb-4 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6\",children:[q(\"li\",{children:[Y(\"strong\",{className:\"text-white\",children:\"Log out of midjourney.com completely\"}),\" before creating your new account. If you're already signed in, the signup flow may attach the coupon to the wrong session.\"]}),q(\"li\",{children:[\"An active \",Y(\"a\",{className:\"text-[#8b7cff] hover:underline\",href:\"https://www.midjourney.com\",target:\"_blank\",rel:\"noopener noreferrer\",children:\"Midjourney\"}),\" Mega subscription — during the AI Hackathon, sign up with a \",Y(\"strong\",{className:\"text-white\",children:\"new account\"}),\" using the provided coupon (sent separately) and select a Mega plan. If you already have a Midjourney account, create a fresh one — there is no way to apply a coupon to an existing subscription.\"]}),q(\"li\",{children:[\"We recommend signing in with \",Y(\"strong\",{className:\"text-white\",children:\"Google\"}),\" (e.g. your school .edu account) rather than Discord. Discord sign-in adds a layer of browser-session complexity — when the MCP OAuth popup opens later, it picks up whichever Discord account your browser is logged into, which may not be the hackathon one.\"]}),q(\"li\",{children:[Y(\"strong\",{className:\"text-white\",children:\"Verify your account is set up correctly.\"}),\" After redeeming the coupon, go to your account settings and confirm your Plan shows \",Y(\"strong\",{className:\"text-white\",children:\"Mega\"}),\" and the Provider matches the sign-in method you used. If you don't see Mega, you may have signed into an existing account — log out and start fresh.\"]}),q(\"li\",{children:[Y(\"strong\",{className:\"text-white\",children:\"Complete your personalization profile on the website before using the MCP.\"}),\" New accounts may be placed into a personalization experiment that requires you to set up a style profile before generating. Do this at \",Y(\"a\",{className:\"text-[#8b7cff] hover:underline\",href:\"https://www.midjourney.com\",target:\"_blank\",rel:\"noopener noreferrer\",children:\"midjourney.com\"}),\" first to avoid errors when generating via MCP.\"]}),Y(\"li\",{children:\"An MCP-compatible AI client (Claude Desktop, Claude Code, Cursor, Windsurf, etc.)\"})]}),Y(cq,{children:Y(M5,{children:\"Image generations consume GPU time from your plan's allocation, the same as generating on the website or Discord.\"})})]})},{title:\"Quickstart\",body:q(a,{children:[Y(M5,{children:\"Add the Midjourney MCP server to your AI client. This is a one-line config change — no API keys, no install.\"}),Y(\"h3\",{className:\"mb-2 mt-7 text-[17px] text-white\",children:\"Claude Desktop\"}),Y(M5,{children:'Open Settings → Developer → Add MCP Server. Choose \"Custom\" as the integration type, give it a name (e.g. \"midjourney\"), and paste the server URL:'}),Y(FQ,{children:\"https://mcp.midjourney.com/mcp\"}),Y(M5,{children:\"Alternatively, edit the config file directly:\"}),q(M5,{children:[Y(\"code\",{className:\"rounded border border-[#2a2a30] bg-[#161619] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.86em]\",children:\"~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json\"}),\" (macOS)\",Y(\"br\",{}),Y(\"code\",{className:\"rounded border border-[#2a2a30] bg-[#161619] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.86em]\",children:\"%APPDATA%\\\\Claude\\\\claude_desktop_config.json\"}),\" (Windows)\"]}),Y(FQ,{children:`{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"midjourney\": {\n      \"url\": \"https://mcp.midjourney.com/mcp\"\n    }\n  }\n}`}),Y(M5,{children:\"Restart Claude Desktop after saving. A Midjourney hammer icon should appear in the toolbar.\"}),Y(\"h3\",{className:\"mb-2 mt-7 text-[17px] text-white\",children:\"Claude Code\"}),Y(FQ,{children:\"claude mcp add midjourney --transport http https://mcp.midjourney.com/mcp\"}),q(M5,{children:[\"Or add to \",Y(\"code\",{className:\"rounded border border-[#2a2a30] bg-[#161619] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.86em]\",children:\".mcp.json\"}),\" in your project root:\"]}),Y(FQ,{children:`{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"midjourney\": {\n      \"url\": \"https://mcp.midjourney.com/mcp\"\n    }\n  }\n}`}),Y(\"h3\",{className:\"mb-2 mt-7 text-[17px] text-white\",children:\"Cursor\"}),q(M5,{children:[\"Add to \",Y(\"code\",{className:\"rounded border border-[#2a2a30] bg-[#161619] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.86em]\",children:\".cursor/mcp.json\"}),\" in your project root:\"]}),Y(FQ,{children:`{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"midjourney\": {\n      \"url\": \"https://mcp.midjourney.com/mcp\"\n    }\n  }\n}`}),Y(\"h3\",{className:\"mb-2 mt-7 text-[17px] text-white\",children:\"Other Clients\"}),Y(M5,{children:\"Any MCP-compatible client works. Point it at:\"}),Y(FQ,{children:`Server URL: https://mcp.midjourney.com/mcp\nTransport:  Streamable HTTP\nAuth:       OAuth 2.1 (automatic)`}),Y(cq,{children:q(M5,{children:[Y(\"strong\",{className:\"text-[#8b7cff]\",children:\"First-time auth: \"}),\"The first time you generate an image, a browser window will open asking you to log in to Midjourney and authorize access. \",Y(\"strong\",{className:\"text-white\",children:\"Make sure you're logged into midjourney.com with your hackathon (coupon) account\"}),\", not a personal account. This only happens once — after that, your session stays active.\"]})}),q(cq,{type:\"warn\",children:[Y(M5,{children:Y(\"strong\",{className:\"text-[#d29922]\",children:\"Auth troubleshooting tips: \"})}),q(\"ul\",{className:\"mb-2 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6\",children:[Y(\"li\",{children:\"Log out of all Midjourney sessions in your browser before authenticating. If you're signed into a different account, the MCP will pick up that session instead of the one with your coupon.\"}),Y(\"li\",{children:\"If using Claude Code and the auth flow shows a localhost page, copy the URL from your browser's address bar and paste it back into Claude Code — this completes the OAuth redirect.\"}),Y(\"li\",{children:\"Claude Teams/Enterprise accounts restrict adding custom MCP servers. Use a personal Claude account or Claude Code with an API key.\"})]})]})]})},{title:\"What You Can Do\",body:q(a,{children:[q(\"ul\",{className:\"mb-5 list-disc space-y-3 pl-6\",children:[q(\"li\",{children:[Y(\"strong\",{className:\"text-white\",children:\"Create \"}),\"— generate a four-image grid from a text prompt, with full support for Midjourney parameters like --ar (aspect ratio), --sref (style reference), --stylize, --chaos, --weird, --no (negative prompt), --raw, --q, --v, --tile, and --hd.\"]}),q(\"li\",{children:[Y(\"strong\",{className:\"text-white\",children:\"Refine and edit \"}),\"— take any image from a grid and make a variation, upscale it to higher resolution, repaint part of it, zoom out to reveal more of the scene, or extend it past any edge.\"]}),q(\"li\",{children:[Y(\"strong\",{className:\"text-white\",children:\"Personalize \"}),\"— list your saved personalization codes and apply them with --p to steer results toward your own style.\"]}),q(\"li\",{children:[Y(\"strong\",{className:\"text-white\",children:\"Pick up where you left off \"}),\"— browse your recent generations, and trace exactly how any image was made: its prompt, parameters, and full edit history.\"]}),q(\"li\",{children:[Y(\"strong\",{className:\"text-white\",children:\"Check your account \"}),\"— see your plan, your remaining fast-time, and how many images you can run at once.\"]}),q(\"li\",{children:[Y(\"strong\",{className:\"text-white\",children:\"Get the full-resolution file \"}),\"— every result includes a link your assistant can fetch for the original image.\"]})]}),q(cq,{type:\"warn\",children:[q(M5,{children:[Y(\"strong\",{className:\"text-[#d29922]\",children:\"Keep in mind: \"}),\"Each image can take multiple seconds to run (sometimes more than 10) — that's normal, not a hang. For speed, ask for several at once; your assistant can run them in parallel.\"]}),Y(M5,{children:`Generations spend fast-time from your plan. Just ask \"what's my account status?\" to keep an eye on your remaining budget.`}),Y(M5,{children:\"To view or download a result at full resolution, open its midjourney.com link — your assistant returns one with every job.\"})]})]})},{title:\"Available Tools\",body:q(a,{children:[Y(\"h3\",{className:\"mb-2 mt-1 text-[17px] text-white\",children:Y(\"code\",{className:\"text-[15px]\",children:\"generate_image\"})}),Y(M5,{children:\"Generate an image from a text prompt. All standard Midjourney parameters can be included in the prompt string.\"}),q(\"table\",{className:\"mb-5 w-full border-collapse text-[14.5px]\",children:[Y(\"thead\",{children:q(\"tr\",{className:\"text-left text-[13px] text-[#9a9aa3]\",children:[Y(\"th\",{className:\"border-b border-[#2a2a30] px-3 py-2.5 font-semibold\",children:\"Parameter\"}),Y(\"th\",{className:\"border-b border-[#2a2a30] px-3 py-2.5 font-semibold\",children:\"Type\"}),Y(\"th\",{className:\"border-b border-[#2a2a30] px-3 py-2.5 font-semibold\",children:\"Description\"})]})}),Y(\"tbody\",{children:q(\"tr\",{className:\"align-top\",children:[q(\"td\",{className:\"border-b border-[#2a2a30] px-3 py-2.5 font-mono text-[13px]\",children:[\"prompt \",Y(\"span\",{className:\"rounded bg-[rgba(248,81,73,0.15)] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase text-[#f85149]\",children:\"required\"})]}),Y(\"td\",{className:\"border-b border-[#2a2a30] px-3 py-2.5 font-mono text-[13px]\",children:\"string\"}),Y(\"td\",{className:\"border-b border-[#2a2a30] px-3 py-2.5\",children:\"Text description + any Midjourney parameters (e.g. --ar 16:9 --v 7)\"})]})})]}),Y(M5,{children:\"Returns a preview image, job metadata (job ID, CDN URL, resource URI), and a resource link for the full-resolution result.\"}),Y(FQ,{children:`// Example response metadata\n{\n  \"job_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n  \"grid_index\": 0,\n  \"cdn_url\": \"https://cdn.midjourney.com/a1b2c3d4.../0_0.jpeg\",\n  \"resource_uri\": \"mi