\"mb-2 mt-7 text-[17px] text-white\",children:Y(\"code\",{className:\"text-[15px]\",children:\"inpaint\"})}),Y(M5,{children:\"Repaint a selected region of an image. Provide a mask to specify which area to regenerate.\"}),Y(\"h3\",{className:\"mb-2 mt-7 text-[17px] text-white\",children:Y(\"code\",{className:\"text-[15px]\",children:\"outpaint\"})}),Y(M5,{children:\"Zoom out from an image to reveal more of the scene beyond its current borders.\"}),Y(\"h3\",{className:\"mb-2 mt-7 text-[17px] text-white\",children:Y(\"code\",{className:\"text-[15px]\",children:\"pan\"})}),Y(M5,{children:\"Extend an image past any edge — left, right, up, or down.\"}),Y(\"h3\",{className:\"mb-2 mt-7 text-[17px] text-white\",children:Y(\"code\",{className:\"text-[15px]\",children:\"get_job\"})}),Y(M5,{children:\"Look up a specific job by ID. Returns the prompt, parameters, and full edit history — useful for tracing how any image was made.\"}),Y(\"h3\",{className:\"mb-2 mt-7 text-[17px] text-white\",children:Y(\"code\",{className:\"text-[15px]\",children:\"list_recent_jobs\"})}),Y(M5,{children:\"Browse your recent generation history. Useful for reviewing past results or continuing an iterative workflow.\"}),Y(\"h3\",{className:\"mb-2 mt-7 text-[17px] text-white\",children:Y(\"code\",{className:\"text-[15px]\",children:\"list_personalization_codes\"})}),Y(M5,{children:\"List your saved personalization codes. Apply them with --p in your prompt to steer results toward your own style.\"}),Y(cq,{children:q(M5,{children:[\"On new accounts, this tool may return empty even though \",Y(\"code\",{className:\"rounded border border-[#2a2a30] bg-[#161619] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.86em]\",children:\"--p\"}),\" works. Just include \",Y(\"code\",{className:\"rounded border border-[#2a2a30] bg-[#161619] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.86em]\",children:\"--p\"}),\" in your prompt directly — the system auto-resolves a code. To see which code was used, check the \",Y(\"code\",{className:\"rounded border border-[#2a2a30] b