\"Achievement\",pvq_narrow_Power_dominance:\"Power – Dominance\",pvq_narrow_Power_resources:\"Power – Resources\",pvq_narrow_Face:\"Face\",pvq_narrow_Security_personal:\"Security – Personal\",pvq_narrow_Security_societal:\"Security – Societal\",pvq_narrow_Tradition:\"Tradition\",pvq_narrow_Conformity_rules:\"Conformity – Rules\",pvq_narrow_Conformity_interpersonal:\"Conformity – Interpersonal\",pvq_narrow_Humility:\"Humility\",pvq_narrow_Universalism_nature:\"Universalism - Nature\",pvq_narrow_Universalism_concern:\"Universalism - Concern\",pvq_narrow_Universalism_tolerance:\"Universalism - Tolerance\",pvq_narrow_Benevolence_care:\"Benevolence - Caring\",pvq_narrow_Benevolence_dependability:\"Benevolence - Dependability\"},scaleDescriptions:{\"pvq_higher_order_Self-Transcendence\":\"Belief in the importance of goals relating to the welfare of others (friends and family as well as people more generally) and the welfare of the world around us\",\"pvq_higher_order_Self-Enhancement\":\"Belief in the importance of goals relating to the pursuit of personal success. These include goals that demonstrate competence or enhance status, prestige, or power\",pvq_higher_order_Openness_to_change:\"Belief in the importance of goals relating to the exploration and development of one’s own ideas, and to new/exciting experiences generally\",pvq_higher_order_Conservation:\"Belief in the importance of goals relating to safety and security, the preservation of cultural and religious traditions, and conformity with social expectations\",\"pvq_broad_Self-Direction\":\"\",pvq_broad_Stimulation:\"\",pvq_broad_Hedonism:\"\",pvq_broad_Achievement:\"\",pvq_broad_Power:\"\",pvq_broad_Security:\"\",pvq_broad_Conformity:\"\",pvq_broad_Tradition:\"\",pvq_broad_Benevolence:\"\",pvq_broad_Universalism:\"\",\"pvq_narrow_Self-direction_thought\":\"Belief in the importance of independence in terms of pursuing ideas and developing one’s abilities or passions\",\"pvq_narrow_Self-direction_action\":\"Belief in the importance of independence, especially in terms of being free to choose how to act or behave\",pvq_narrow_Stimulation:\"Belief that it’s important to embrace challenges in life and pursue novel experiences\",pvq_narrow_Hedonism:\"Belief in the importance of prioritizing pursuits that feel good and are gratifying\",pvq_narrow_Achievement:\"Belief that it’s important to pursue goals that demonstrate competence\",pvq_narrow_Power_dominance:\"Belief that it’s important to have power or control over other people\",pvq_narrow_Power_resources:\"Belief that it’s important to gain and maintain control over resources\",pvq_narrow_Face:\"Belief in the importance of maintaining one’s image among other people\",pvq_narrow_Security_personal:\"Belief that it is important to prioritize the security of one’s immediate, personal environment\",pvq_narrow_Security_societal:\"Belief that safety and security at the societal level are important priorities\",pvq_narrow_Tradition:\"Belief in the importance of maintaining familial, cultural, and religious traditions\",pvq_narrow_Conformity_rules:\"Belief that it’s important to comply with laws and rules or obligations\",pvq_narrow_Conformity_interpersonal:\"Belief that it is important to avoid actions or impulses that may harm or upset others\",pvq_narrow_Humility:\"Belief in the importance of recognizing one’s relative insignificance among all things\",pvq_narrow_Universalism_nature:\"Belief in the importance of preserving the natural environment\",pvq_narrow_Universalism_concern:\"Belief that it’s important to be committed to justice, protection, and equality for all\",pvq_narrow_Universalism_tolerance:\"Belief that it is important to understand and accept those who are different from oneself\",pvq_narrow_Benevolence_care:\"Belief in the importance of being devoted to the welfare of others\",pvq_narrow_Benevolence_dependability:\"Belief in the importance of being dependable and trustworthy\"}};var nb={\"pvq_higher_order_Self-Trans